  title: Indian painting
  text: Indian painting includes the Ajanta murals, Pala manuscripts, Mughal, Rajput and Pahari miniatures, the Tanjore and Kalighat schools, folk forms such as Madhubani, Warli and Pattachitra, and modern artists such as Raja Ravi Varma and Amrita Sher-Gil.
